{"key": "914dbe5b037e6504ecf9f128dcada48d547fd2ba", "paraphrases": ["You're just standing there while I'm doing all the work.", "Staying put like that is just wasting our time.", "Holding back doesn't help when the soup's already done.", "Your spot is useless right now, we need you moving.", "Just standing around while I grab the onion is pointless.", "Being idle there is slowing us down for no reason."]}
{"key": "babf8c95847af1ff077bdaa82cf71a418764143b", "paraphrases": ["Good call staying put, that lets me grab the dish.", "Nice, holding back works perfectly here.", "Staying there is smart, I'll handle the plate.", "Perfect, you hold your spot while I get the dish.", "Good move keeping your position, that splits it well.", "Right call to stay, I'll take care of the rest."]}
{"key": "5b69b086e4a7d46ef90a8c32ce9f8b279a72ef7e", "paraphrases": ["Nice, just hold your spot there.", "Good, stay put while I grab the dish.", "Perfect, you stay right there.", "Keep holding back, that works great.", "You're doing well staying in place.", "Just stay where you are, that's perfect."]}
{"key": "538117ae8c98f78e0b033c74c15a36d9de5d3c45", "paraphrases": ["I need you to not serve that soup right now, you're in my way.", "Serving the soup is a bad move because you're blocking me from getting the dish.", "Putting that soup down now is wrong, you're blocking my path.", "Don't serve the soup yet, you're just getting in my way.", "That soup serve is a mistake, you're blocking me from the plates.", "Serving the soup right now is a bad call, you're in my way."]}
{"key": "d49374b120c261eeea813eff63ab87466c3a9476", "paraphrases": ["You're serving the soup right in my path, so I can't get to the dishes.", "Blocking me with that soup delivery means I'm stuck waiting.", "Carrying that soup through my way is making me lose time.", "Serving the soup now is just getting in my way with the dishes.", "That soup run is cutting me off from the plates I need.", "Your soup serving is right where I'm trying to move, so it's a problem."]}
{"key": "6efff81d49fbb926e967ab8037b822771f104750", "paraphrases": []}
{"key": "e0746f2a2291e36371a36c4bf61f0c444ba776f2", "paraphrases": ["Good, you stay right there and I'll grab the soup.", "Perfect, just hold your spot while I handle this.", "Nice, keep waiting there and I'll take care of it.", "You're doing great staying put, I'm on the soup.", "Awesome, hold back and let me get that.", "Just stay where you are, I've got the soup covered."]}
{"key": "728d63b19255087144852809dc0c53e3d6255292", "paraphrases": []}
{"key": "fd942e51a85a4baa3a848a8c48c93dcdb03ea1cd", "paraphrases": ["You're serving the soup right in my path.", "Now I have to wait because you're serving that soup where I need to go.", "That soup you're serving is blocking me from getting to the counter.", "I can't move because you're serving the soup right in front of me.", "Serving the soup there just traps me behind you.", "You're holding up the whole kitchen by serving that soup in my way."]}
{"key": "8d621867d0ba1fd51c10cb64373429240ca02b87", "paraphrases": ["Good call staying put, that lets me handle the serving.", "Nice, holding back there keeps us from bumping into each other.", "Staying in your spot works perfectly while I grab the plates.", "Smart move just waiting, we've got this covered.", "Perfect, you holding back means no wasted movement.", "Love that you're staying put, keeps our flow smooth."]}
{"key": "c7482fed9f2d3a270978b913047cca0c11523fb9", "paraphrases": ["Good, you stay right there and let me handle the serving.", "Perfect, just hold your spot while I grab the plates.", "Nice, keep holding back and I'll take it from here.", "You're doing great staying put, that's exactly what we need.", "Awesome, just stay where you are and I'll get the soup out.", "Way to hold your position, that splits the work perfectly."]}
